Package: soundcloud-cardputer
Version: 1.0.3
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Egor <egorkhlud9-cell@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pygame, python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-evdev, mpv, yt-dlp
Description: Native SoundCloud player for Cardputer Zero
 Pillow framebuffer interface with Linux keyboard input and MPV playback, public SoundCloud search,
 local favorites, playlists and playback history. No API keys or subscription required.
